WEBVTT

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:12.000
<v Professor>Welcome back. Today we cover vector databases and similarity search.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:20.000
<v Professor>An embedding maps text to a point in high dimensional space, so similar meanings end up close together.

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:18.000
<v Professor>Cosine distance measures the angle between two vectors, which is why it ignores vector length.
